      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOWERING FORTUNE (7) made an immediate impact on debut last start, scoring by 5 metres over 1609m at this track. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Finds a nice race and will be a major force once more. MY MCLAREN (8) has been racing well of late. Finished second at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, beaten 1.2 metres. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Leading hope based on those recent efforts. ARTISTIC GALAXY (6) finished ninth last start over 1609m at this track two weeks ago. This looks a suitable race and a top-three finish looks on the cards. ULTIMATE MARTHA (9) is at the track for the first time. By Ultimate Sniper and hails from the Ross Adams stable. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Was not far away in a recent trial. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to her career.",
